From 86d86f2f155eae6b68bba99a980581809c619885 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vlad Syan <vlad.syan@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:50:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] Plane: RFS_MIN_LEG default 500 m

At 1500 m a sweep could not start within 1.5 km of the next waypoint (or 500 m
of the previous one), which skipped useful sweeps near the turns; 500 m keeps
the circle clear of the waypoint turn.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 ArduPlane/rf_search.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ArduPlane/rf_search.cpp b/ArduPlane/rf_search.cpp
index 8a3254c301..8589fc126a 100644
--- a/ArduPlane/rf_search.cpp
+++ b/ArduPlane/rf_search.cpp
@@ -40,7 +40,7 @@ const AP_Param::GroupInfo RFSearch::var_info[] = {
     // @Units: m
     // @Range: 300 10000
     // @User: Standard
-    AP_GROUPINFO("MIN_LEG", 4, RFSearch, _min_leg_m, 1500.0f),
+    AP_GROUPINFO("MIN_LEG", 4, RFSearch, _min_leg_m, 500.0f),
 
     // @Param: STALE
     // @DisplayName: RF reading timeout
-- 
2.43.0

